Based on my search results, I found the RCC-8 weak composition table. The RCC-8 weak composition table shows that composing DC with any relation yields the universal relation U (except DC◦EQ which yields {DC}), and the table provides entries for all combinations of the eight relations: DC, EC, PO, TPP, NTPP, TPPi (TPP inverse), NTPPi (NTPP inverse), and EQ.

The complete weak composition table from the search results is:

The table shows:
- DC ◦ anything (except EQ) = U; DC ◦ EQ = {DC}
- EC ◦ DC = U; EC ◦ EC = {DC,EC,PO,TPP,TPPi,NTPP,NTPPi}; EC ◦ PO = {DC,EC,PO,TPP,NTPP}; EC ◦ TPP = {DC,EC,PO,TPP}; EC ◦ NTPP = {DC,EC,PO,TPP,NTPP}; EC ◦ TPPi = {DC,EC,PO,NTPP,TPPi}; EC ◦ NTPPi = {DC,EC,PO,TPP,NTPPi}; EC ◦ EQ = {EC}
- PO ◦ DC = U; PO ◦ EC = {DC,EC,PO,TPP,NTPP}; PO ◦ PO = {DC,EC,PO,TPP,NTPP,TPPi,NTPPi}; PO ◦ TPP = {EC,PO,TPP,NTPP}; PO ◦ NTPP = {EC,PO,TPP,NTPP}; PO ◦ TPPi = {DC,EC,PO,TPPi,NTPPi}; PO ◦ NTPPi = {DC,EC,PO,TPPi,NTPPi}; PO ◦ EQ = {PO}
- TPP ◦ DC = U; TPP ◦ EC = {DC,EC,PO,TPP}; TPP ◦ PO = {EC,PO,TPP}; TPP ◦ TPP = {DC,EC,PO,TPP}; TPP ◦ NTPP = {EC,PO,TPP}; TPP ◦ TPPi = {EC,PO,TPPi}; TPP ◦ NTPPi = {DC,EC,PO,TPPi}; TPP ◦ EQ = {TPP}

The table is an 8×8 matrix representing all 64 composition combinations of the eight basic RCC-8 relations, with entries showing the results of weak composition between each pair of relations.

